        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-10T13:42:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Ehkrickor\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ehkrickor/48/2035_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ehkrickor:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>… we're getting ready to restart Legend of the Five rings with the new FFS Beta material.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>One of my good friends is the line developer at FFG on L5R. &nbsp;I just went to her wedding up in Minneapolis in August. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
