        "id": 205914,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-11T13:44:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Her name's Kat Ostrander--she started working there on the Star Wars line (particularly the Edge of the Empire products), before moving into the fiction department, then onto L5R. &nbsp;It's really fitting, as she's an absolute die-hard L5R fangirl. &nbsp;</p><p>In a somewhat ironic twist of fate, I actually ended up driving her to the airport for her job interview with FFG. &nbsp;A few years later, I ended up working for her as a freelancer on \"The Investigators of Arkham Horror.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
