        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ehkrickor/{size}/2035_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-11T13:52:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Very Nice! I'm a big L5R fan so that's definately really cool. All of the fiction is great and there are so many little story twists that diferentiate it from other fictions that it can get really deep. At one point i worked Bayushi's version of the Scorpion and the Frog story into a puzzle for my Scion campaign, it's just so classic villain but he's still technically a good guy, i love it.</p>",
