      {
        "id": 205917,
        "name": "speedyolrac",
        "username": "speedyolrac",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-19T16:08:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I started my Rpg life with 2nd edition and switch back and forth with Old White Wolf stuff. (late 1990 Stuff). I enjoyed it but have no clue what the numbers meant&nbsp;just&nbsp;let other make my characters.</p><p>In college, I DM 3rd edition groups and played some Gurps and Palladium. Then spend years on 3rd (and all its clones) and DM a few BESM (big eye small mouths, love the 4th edition the best) games. Meet up with my high school friends and started playing Exalted 2001 Marvel universe RPG and tried 4th ed D&amp;D.</p><p><span>&nbsp;I have tried a whole mess of RPGs looking for one I enjoy. Then&nbsp;</span><span>I ran a Pathfinder game of Wrath of the Righteous (the Mythic Campain) that pushed me into no longer enjoying Pathfinder.&nbsp;</span><span>Fantasy Flight's Start was it. I enjoy and it is fun. It was my Favorite&nbsp;till I tired SC RPG, now that is my Favorite system. I love playing RPG games.</span></p>",
