        "name": "Cult of Gloom",
        "username": "Cult_of_Gloom",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cult_of_gloom/{size}/1878_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-25T16:28:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The last \"RPG\" system that I used was Microscope, which is really more of a collective world building tool then a game. Still very clever and worth the 10 bucks i paid for it on Drivethru RPG, I might end up doing it before a lot of my RPGs from now on to make a setting.</p>",
